This license covers the pipeline source in this repository only.

It does NOT cover the third-party data the pipeline downloads at run time, each
of which carries its own terms:

  - GRCh38 reference and known-sites VCFs (dbSNP, Mills, known indels) --
    Broad Institute public bundle.
  - Exome capture target BEDs -- Twist Bioscience, Illumina, and IDT. These are
    vendor product designs, are NOT redistributed here, and are fetched from the
    vendors directly. Check each vendor's terms before redistributing them.
  - GIAB / NIST benchmark truth sets -- US Government work, public domain.
  - SnpEff annotation databases -- see the SnpEff project for its terms.
  - The tools themselves (GATK, bwa, samtools, bcftools, SnpEff, hap.py, ...)
    are installed from conda at build time under their own licenses.
